<title>NETHERLANDS: CSM year net rises 8.1 percent.</title>
<headline>CSM year net rises 8.1 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end-September 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     5.17 vs   4.89</p>
<p>    Net profit			   201.60 vs 186.50</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  3.03 vs   2.72</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    293.0 vs 269.70</p>
<p>    Interest income		     19.30 vs  14.30</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    13.20 vs   8.60</p>
<p>    Tax				     97.50 vs  88.90</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast CSM year net at 197-216 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
